---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---
<Layout title="Todd Kashdan | Curiosity, Purpose, and a More Interesting Life" current="home">
  <div class="hero hero-fullbleed">
    <img class="hero-bg" src={base + "images/img_009.jpeg"} alt="Todd Kashdan speaking on stage, presenting a new scientific framework of curiosity, mid-gesture with microphone" />
    <div class="hero-scrim"></div>
    <div class="hero-content">
      <p class="kicker">Psychologist &middot; Scientist &middot; Author &middot; Speaker</p>
      <h1>The science of curiosity, purpose, and a more <em>interesting</em> life.</h1>
      <p class="lead">20+ years of research on purpose in life, curiosity, psychological flexibility, and more.</p>
      <p class="credit">Among the top 1% most-cited scientists in the world. Awarded the <em>2013 Distinguished Early Career Researcher Award</em> by the American Psychological Association.</p>
      <div class="cta">
        <a class="btn solid" href="#quiz">Take the Curiosity Quiz</a>
        <a class="btn ghost" href={base + "well-being-lab/"}>Explore the Well-Being Lab</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="strip">
    <div><div class="n">250+</div><div class="l">Scientific papers on well-being and human performance</div></div>
    <a href="https://scholar.google.com/citations?user=rC3rn04AAAAJ&hl=en&oi=ao" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><div class="n">61,000+</div><div class="l">Citations on Google Scholar &rarr;</div></a>
    <div><div class="n">5</div><div class="l">Books, translated into 15+ languages worldwide</div></div>
    <div><div class="n">HBR &middot; NYT &middot; Hidden Brain</div><div class="l">Ideas featured in Harvard Business Review, The New York Times, NPR's Hidden Brain and more</div></div>
  </div>

  <div class="twoup wrap" style="margin-top:38px;">
    <div class="panel" id="well-being-lab">
      <span class="news-eyebrow">25 Years &middot; Free Research</span>
      <h3>Well-Being Lab</h3>
      <p>Todd founded the Well-Being Lab 25 years ago. Every year since, the lab has produced peer-reviewed research on curiosity, purpose, and psychological flexibility, and given it away for free. That body of work is cited more than 61,000 times on Google Scholar.</p>
      <a href={base + "well-being-lab/"}>Read the science &rarr;</a>
    </div>
    <div class="panel" id="speaking">
      <h3>Speaking &amp; Consulting</h3>
      <p>Keynotes, workshops, and consulting on curiosity, purpose, and performance, for organizations and audiences that want more than a feel-good talk.</p>
      <a href={base + "speaking/"}>Inquire about a speaking engagement &rarr;</a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="press wrap">
    <div class="sec-h"><h2>Todd in the media</h2></div>
    <div class="press-grid">
      <a class="press-item" href="https://www.washingtonpost.com/climate-environment/2025/10/24/happiness-purpose-community-contribution/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span class="press-outlet">Washington Post</span><span class="press-title">This happiness hack can guide you toward a life of purpose</span></a>
      <a class="press-item" href="https://apnews.com/article/purpose-anxiety-wellness-84da5b896fedd7ef5932d63b05a5a7d5" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span class="press-outlet">AP News</span><span class="press-title">Why the search for meaning can cause &lsquo;purpose anxiety,&rsquo; and what to do about it</span></a>
      <a class="press-item" href="https://hbr.org/2022/07/7-rules-for-persuasive-dissent" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span class="press-outlet">Harvard Business Review</span><span class="press-title">The Seven Rules for Persuasive Dissent</span></a>
      <a class="press-item" href="https://hiddenbrain.org/podcast/happiness-2-0-the-only-way-out-is-through/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span class="press-outlet">Hidden Brain</span><span class="press-title">Happiness 2.0: The Only Way Out Is Through</span></a>
      <a class="press-item" href="https://www.nytimes.com/2022/01/19/well/mind/anxiety-benefits.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span class="press-outlet">The New York Times</span><span class="press-title">The Upside of Anxiety</span></a>
      <a class="press-item" href="https://www.theatlantic.com/magazine/archive/2016/10/nice-day-eh/497552/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span class="press-outlet">The Atlantic</span><span class="press-title">Do People Need Small Talk to Be Happy?</span></a>
      <a class="press-item" href="https://www.wsj.com/opinion/psychologists-can-measure-a-smile-c1e20e0a" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span class="press-outlet">Wall Street Journal</span><span class="press-title">Psychologists Can Measure a Smile</span></a>
      <a class="press-item" href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=S7eiIZ81HkQ" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span class="press-outlet">Dr. Phil</span><span class="press-title">Do We Need Trigger Warnings and Safe Spaces?</span></a>
      <a class="press-item" href="https://www.washingtonpost.com/politics/2025/11/21/curiosity-politics-polarization-arguments-thanksgiving/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span class="press-outlet">Washington Post</span><span class="press-title">How Curiosity Could Help Your Thanksgiving Gathering and Our Politics</span></a>
      <a class="press-item" href="https://hbr.org/podcast/2023/02/the-subtle-art-of-disagreeing-with-your-boss" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span class="press-outlet">Harvard Business Review</span><span class="press-title">The Subtle Art of Disagreeing With Your Boss</span></a>
      <a class="press-item" href="https://www.insidehighered.com/views/2022/03/07/ten-principles-embracing-productive-conflict-opinion" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span class="press-outlet">Inside Higher Ed</span><span class="press-title">Ten Principles for Embracing Productive Conflict</span></a>
      <a class="press-item" href="https://hbr.org/2018/09/the-five-dimensions-of-curiosity" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span class="press-outlet">Harvard Business Review</span><span class="press-title">The Five Dimensions of Curiosity</span></a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="books-band wrap">
    <div class="sec-h"><h2>Books</h2><a href={base + "books/"}>See all &rarr;</a></div>
    <div class="grid3">
      <div class="book"><img src={base + "images/img_010.webp"} alt="The Art of Insubordination" /><div><h3>The Art of Insubordination</h3><p>How to dissent and defy effectively. &ldquo;The book all virtuous rebels need.&rdquo;</p><a class="book-buy" href="https://amzn.to/3Ta7SmW">Buy now &rarr;</a></div></div>
      <div class="book"><img src={base + "images/img_011.webp"} alt="The Upside of Your Dark Side" /><div><h3>The Upside of Your Dark Side</h3><p>Why being your whole self, not just your &quot;good&quot; self, drives success.</p><a class="book-buy" href="https://amzn.to/4wXOo3z">Buy now &rarr;</a></div></div>
      <div class="book"><img src={base + "images/img_012.png"} alt="Mindfulness, Acceptance, and Positive Psychology" /><div><h3>Mindfulness, Acceptance, and Positive Psychology</h3><p>The seven foundations of well-being.</p><a class="book-buy" href="https://amzn.to/4frOUj8">Buy now &rarr;</a></div></div>
      <div class="book"><img src={base + "images/img_013.png"} alt="Designing Positive Psychology" /><div><h3>Designing Positive Psychology</h3><p>Taking stock and moving forward, with Kennon Sheldon and Michael Steger.</p><a class="book-buy" href="https://amzn.to/4fJ8sAG">Buy now &rarr;</a></div></div>
      <div class="book"><img src={base + "images/img_014.webp"} alt="Curious?" /><div><h3>Curious?</h3><p>Discover the missing ingredient to a fulfilling life.</p><a class="book-buy" href="https://amzn.to/4wfAh9V">Buy now &rarr;</a></div></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="section wrap">
    <div class="news">
      <div class="news-copy">
        <span class="news-eyebrow">Provoked &middot; Free &amp; Premium</span>
        <h2>Provoked is for playful, intelligent, discerning readers.</h2>
        <p>Cutting-edge well-being insights and an unusual look at what everyone accepts, delivered straight, no filler. Into it? Join free, or go premium for the deep dives.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="news-cta">
        <a class="btn solid" href="https://toddkashdan.substack.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Join free</a>
        <a class="btn ghost" href="https://toddkashdan.substack.com/subscribe" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Go premium &rarr;</a>
        <div class="news-proof">Trusted by <strong>10,000+</strong> subscribers</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
